    "body": "Work cannot start because #2613 and #2615 are not implemented.\n\nI checked upstream/main e042e32f82967f395724e3a37e8640f3c18403f1. The nesting module exports only raster. The raster implementation came from commit 3c3b559bb (#2612).\n\nThe CPU search evaluator from #2613 is absent. The GPU evaluator from #2615 is absent. Both issues remain open. No open PR contains crates/ui/src/nest_gpu.rs or crates/ui/src/nest_raster.wgsl.\n\nThe async device helper exists. It does not provide the missing nesting evaluators. Implementing them here would also work the two prerequisite issues.\n\nSTOPPED before claim. No source files changed. No tests ran. Resume #2616 after its evaluator prerequisites are available.\n",
